(7753614, 1281629, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zoomdak:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by P-A-U-L:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zoomdak:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the blue ribbon. I gave this a 10 in voting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you very much. I hope that generous vote didnt prevent you from getting the blue for your superb photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s a hilarious thought! I just did the math, and if I had only given you a 9, you would have been at 7.31, which would flip us. Or if I had not voted you would have been at 7.27. Tight margins, but well deserved blue ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s the problem with so few voters - one vote can make a heck of a difference.</td>', 'Originally posted by Zoomdak: Originally posted by P-A-U-L: Originally posted by Zoomdak: Congrats on the blue ribbon. I gave this a 10 in voting.   Thank you very much. I hope that generous vote didnt prevent you from getting the blue for your superb photo.   That''s a hilarious thought! I just did the math, and if I had only given you a 9, you would have been at 7.31, which would flip us. Or if I had not voted you would have been at 7.27. Tight margins, but well deserved blue ribbon!   That''s the problem with so few voters - one vote can make a heck of a difference.', '2023-07-09 17:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
